<p>As the war involving the United States, Israel, and Iran widens, the U.S. says it is “accelerating” its campaign and will begin “striking progressively deeper” into Iran. Iran continued retaliatory missile and drone attacks, and the fallout is spreading across the Middle East and beyond. The conflict’s footprint is also expanding in less expected ways, including an Iranian drone incident involving NATO territory and a U.S. submarine attack that sank an Iranian warship off Sri Lanka. With disruption mounting and risks rising for civilians and travelers, governments are urging their citizens to consider leaving countries in the region.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/66S3K7VOU4S4139e7iTiT5TA8In3tmDJHp62K7XC8lfGZCvdVsdpGEvVikuNSJ62SwZa2IrsVzJOSkOxb-NOUsVfSJ75ss4Cx9qPkw5Stw25UJWnagfko5F0lT-D8zIQ1Z-UFoW1BrqL' alt='Coverage image accompanying reporting on expanded U.S. strikes and the widening war with Iran.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Targeting scale: PBS said the U.S. has struck more than 2,000 targets in Iran so far.</li><li>Iraq spillover: Al-Monitor said Iranian strikes have hit areas tied to Kurdish groups in Iraq, as the conflict pushes beyond direct Iran-Israel exchanges.</li><li>Broader disruptions: A regional overview described the war ricocheting across the Middle East and beyond, with multiple countries reporting damage from missile hits, drone strikes, or shrapnel—along with closures affecting embassies, economic hubs, and key passageways.</li><li>Political framing: World Socialist Web Site called the U.S.-Israeli campaign a “war of extermination” and said Washington is fueling conflict inside Iran by supplying arms to Kurdish nationalists—claims presented as its analysis of U.S. aims and methods.</li></ul><blockquote>Just getting started - Pete Hegseth</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>U.S. Defense Department: Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth said the U.S. is “accelerating, not decelerating,” and that the campaign is “just getting started,” signaling more strikes and a broader effort. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/us-iran-war-israel-strikes-tehran-lebanon-day-5-al-udeid-targeted/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Israeli military: Israel’s military said it has “just begun” a large-scale wave of strikes on what it called Iranian regime infrastructure across Tehran. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/war-middle-east-latest-developments-0'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Russia: RT said Russia called for de-escalation as the U.S. expanded attacks and Iran retaliated. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633831-us-israeli-war-on-iran-live-updates/'>RT</a>)</li><li>World Socialist Web Site: WSWS described the war as a U.S.-Israeli assault aimed at “annihilation and extermination,” and argued the conflict is growing as more powers are pulled in. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/05/bhwa-m05.html'>World Socialist Web Site</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/04/2026/us-says-it-is-accelerating-iran-attacks'>US says it is &#x27;accelerating&#x27; Iran attacks</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3345492/guide-how-iran-war-has-ricocheted-across-middle-east-and-beyond'>A guide to how the Iran war has ricocheted across the Middle East and beyond</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/u-s-says-it-will-strike-deeper-into-iran-saying-war-has-only-just-begun'>U.S. says it will strike deeper into Iran, saying war has &#x27;only just begun&#x27;</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/us-accelerates-attacks-on-iran-as-war-widens-across-west-asia-13986340.html'>US accelerates attacks on Iran as war widens across West Asia</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/05/bhwa-m05.html'>American imperialism wages war of extermination against Iran</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/war-middle-east-latest-developments-0'>War in the Middle East: latest developments</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633831-us-israeli-war-on-iran-live-updates/'>US-Israeli war on Iran plunges Middle East into chaos: Live Updates (PHOTOS, VIDEOS)</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/us-iran-war-israel-strikes-tehran-lebanon-day-5-al-udeid-targeted/'>Hegseth says U.S. &quot;just getting started&quot; as Iran war spreads</a> - cbsnews.com</li></ul>